{"2cm_flak38" "The FlaK 38 is Germany's most numerous light anti-aircraft gun and devastating against infantry and light targets. It lacks the fire rate and payload to be effective against aircraft."}
; -- group c4 --
; [new] card "2cm_flakvierling38" cost 250 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x4 | tags 44 45 43 42 41 | units/ger/vehicles_44.set:34
{"2cm_flakvierling38" "The Flakvierling 38 combines four FlaK 38s on a quad mount, effective against aircraft and soft ground targets but not armour. Its rapid fire uses up ammunition fast."}
; -- group c5 --
; [new] card "37mm_flak_36" cost 250 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x2 | tags 44 45 43 42 41 | units/ger/vehicles_44.set:37
{"37mm_flak_36" "The 37mm FlaK 36 is an anti-aircraft gun firing a payload eight times larger than the 20mm FlaK 38. It is far more effective against high-flying aircraft and armoured targets."}
; -- group c133 --
; [new] card "15_cm_sig33" cost 750 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x2 | tags artillery 44 45 43 42 41 | units/ger/vehicles_44.set:53
{"15_cm_sig33" "The 150mm sIG 33 is a 2-ton heavy infantry gun whose explosive payload demolishes infantry, emplacements and almost any armoured vehicle. Beware of counter-artillery fire."}
; -- group c14 --
; [new] card "stuh42" cost 600 lvl 1 | soldiers tankman x4, tankman2 | tags medium 44 45 43 | units/ger/vehicles_44.set:56 | also under ger_ss/v2; cards stuh42, stuh42_ss(ger_ss)
{"stuh42" "The StuH 42 is a StuG III with a 105 mm LeFH 18 howitzer for demolishing fortifications, laying smoke and some anti-tank work. Slow reload and short range suit neither tank hunting nor artillery."}
; -- group c17 --
; [new] card "sig33b" cost 850 lvl 1 | soldiers tankman2, tankman x4 | tags medium 44 43 42 | units/ger/vehicles_44.set:57
{"sig33b" "The StuIG 33B is an infantry gun on a tank chassis. Its explosive power works against fortifications, tanks and large groups of infantry, as long as you keep it supplied with ammunition."}
; -- group c15 --
; [new] card "brummbar_early" cost 1050 lvl 1 | soldiers tankman x3, tankman2 | tags medium 44 45 43 | units/ger/vehicles_44.set:58 | also under ger_ss/v2; cards brummbar_early, brummbar_ss(ger_ss)
{"brummbar_early" "The Sturmpanzer IV (Stupa) carries a StuH43 demolition gun and 100mm sloped frontal armour on a Panzer IV chassis. It can destroy even the heaviest tanks and fire in a slight arc."}
; -- group c1 --
; [new] card "mg34_lafette" cost 150 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x2 | tags 45 43 42 41 | units/vehicles_x.set:38 | also under ger_ss/v2; cards mg34_lafette, mg34_lafette_ss
{"mg34_lafette" "A MG 34 on a tripod mount."}
; -- group c13 --
; [new] card "75mm_leig18" cost 320 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x2 | tags artillery 45 43 42 41 | units/vehicles_x.set:40
{"75mm_leig18" "The 75mm leIG 18 is a Wehrmacht infantry support gun for attacking emplacements. Its HEAT round gives only mediocre anti-tank defense."}
; -- group c11 --
; [new] card "pak43" cost 850 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x2 | tags heavy 45 43 | units/vehicles_x.set:198 | also under ger_ss/v2; cards pak43, pak43_ss(ger_ss)
{"pak43" "The 88mm PaK 43 is an anti-tank gun built to penetrate the heaviest Allied tanks, including the M26 Pershing, Churchill Mk. VIII and IS-2. It is a highly effective weapon."}
; [new] card "pak44" cost 950 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x2 | tags artillery heavy 45 | units/vehicles_x.set:199 | also under ger_ss/v2; cards pak44, pak44_ss(ger_ss)
{"pak44" "The PaK 44 is a 128mm anti-tank and field gun built to answer Russian 122mm guns and heavy armour. At 11 tons it is too heavy to tow, so crews usually flee when the enemy approaches."}
; -- group c12 --
; [new] card "how_aa(ger)" cost 700 lvl 1 | soldiers vehicle_supporter x2 | vehicles flak36a | tags medium 45 43 | units/ger/vehicles_45.set:55 | {info flak36a}; also under ger_ss/v2; cards how_aa(ger), how_aa(ger_ss), how_aa_2(ger); copy of flak36a (with crew)
{"flak36a" "The 88mm FlaK 36 is an all-round anti-aircraft gun whose high muzzle velocity and large calibre also make it an excellent long-range anti-tank gun. It has APCBC, HE, APCR and HEAT ammo."}
